if {quest.qa_errand} == "not_started":
	guide: New here? Everything on this field is for trying out. I could use a hand while you are at it.
	- What do you need?
		[signal arg="start_quest qa_errand"]
		[signal arg="progress talk_guide"]
		guide: Firewood and supper. Take an axe to one of the trees, then cast a line in the pool. I will make it worth your while.
	- Maybe later.
elif {quest.qa_errand} == "active":
	guide: The axes are by the spawn and the rod is a walk-over pickup. The pool is south of here.
else:
	guide: Wood and fish, just as asked. The apples are yours.
[end_timeline]
